### FMCG Platform API — VS Code REST Client
### Install: REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### Usage: click "Send Request" above any request

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# AUTH
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fmcg.kz",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# DASHBOARD
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Get KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/kpis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Sales by Branch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/sales-by-branch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Sales by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/sales-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Top Slow Stock (days_supply > 90)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/top-slow-stock?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# UPLOAD
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Upload Sales file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sales.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./test_data/sales_sample.xlsx
------FormBoundary--

###

### Upload Stock file
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="stock.xls"
Content-Type: application/vnd.ms-excel

< ./test_data/stock_sample.xls
------FormBoundary--

###

### Get Upload History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# SALES
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Get All Sales (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Filter by branch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?branch_code=ASTANA&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales?category=МАСЛО&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Export to Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sales/export?category=МАСЛО
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# STOCK
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Get Stock (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Critical Stock only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock?flag=critical
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Stock Matrix (SKU × branches)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/matrix?category=ЧАЙ
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# DEBTS
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Get All Debts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Critical Debts only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debts?status=critical
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# ORDERS
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Pending Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create New Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branch_id": "BRANCH_UUID_HERE",
  "comment": "Срочная заявка",
  "items": [
    {
      "nomenclature_id": "NOM_UUID_HERE",
      "qty": 100,
      "price": 850.00
    },
    {
      "nomenclature_id": "NOM_UUID_2_HERE",
      "qty": 50,
      "price": 1200.00
    }
  ]
}

###

### Confirm Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/ORDER_UUID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

###

### Cancel Order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/ORDER_UUID_HERE/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}

###

# ══════════════════════════════════════
# HEALTH
# ══════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### API Docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

###
